1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,161
You've grown a hundred times taller.

2
00:00:02,661 --> 00:00:05,001
You now weigh seventy thousand tonnes.

3
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:06,602
More than the Titanic.

4
00:00:07,062 --> 00:00:08,762
But your bones only got ten

5
00:00:08,822 --> 00:00:10,003
thousand times stronger.

6
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:11,523
So your first step...

7
00:00:12,803 --> 00:00:13,744
snaps your legs.

8
00:00:14,384 --> 00:00:15,024
If you fall,

9
00:00:15,284 --> 00:00:16,624
your head hits the ground as

10
00:00:16,784 --> 00:00:17,985
fast as a race car.

11
00:00:18,425 --> 00:00:20,225
Your heart can't push blood forty

12
00:00:20,285 --> 00:00:21,346
metres up to your brain.

13
00:00:21,766 --> 00:00:22,526
You'd black out.

14
00:00:22,966 --> 00:00:23,986
You'd overheat too.

15
00:00:24,446 --> 00:00:26,007
A million times more heat...

16
00:00:26,387 --> 00:00:28,027
with only ten thousand times more

17
00:00:28,107 --> 00:00:28,447
skin.

18
00:00:28,888 --> 00:00:29,848
You shout for help...

19
00:00:30,248 --> 00:00:31,668
but your voice is too deep

20
00:00:31,728 --> 00:00:32,709
for anyone to hear.

21
00:00:33,209 --> 00:00:34,489
So you try to take one

22
00:00:34,689 --> 00:00:35,509
careful step...

